{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-47656","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54212","text":"OpenSentience Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47658","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54213","marks":["bold"],"text":"\"Intelligence is not generation. It is structured accumulation.\""}]}],"id":"blk-47657","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47660","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54214","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-54215","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-54216","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-54217","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-54218","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-54219","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-54220","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-47659","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-47661","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54221","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-54222","marks":["bold"],"text":"OpenSentience"},{"id":"spn-54223","text":" — the research arm and runtime governance layer of the [&] Protocol ecosystem."}]},{"id":"blk-47662","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54224","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47663","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54225","text":"What Is OpenSentience?"}]},{"id":"blk-47664","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54226","text":"OpenSentience is "},{"id":"spn-54227","marks":["bold"],"text":"not a product"},{"id":"spn-54228","text":". It is three things:"}]},{"id":"blk-47665","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54229","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-54230","marks":["bold"],"text":"A research organization"},{"id":"spn-54231","text":" that publishes cognitive protocols — formal specifications grounding AI agent architecture in cognitive science. 2. "},{"id":"spn-54232","marks":["bold"],"text":"A thin governance shim"},{"id":"spn-54233","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-54234","marks":["code"],"text":"open_sentience"},{"id":"spn-54235","text":" hex package) that enforces permission, lifecycle, and autonomy policies on OTP-supervised agents. 3. "},{"id":"spn-54236","marks":["bold"],"text":"The home of two cross-cutting protocols"},{"id":"spn-54237","text":" — OS-009 PRISM (diagnostic benchmark) and OS-010 PULSE (loop manifest standard) — that sit above the eight cognitive primitives and turn the [&] portfolio into a measurable, composable, accountable agent substrate."}]},{"id":"blk-47666","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54238","text":"The research output is "},{"id":"spn-54239","marks":["bold"],"text":"ten numbered protocols"},{"id":"spn-54240","text":" organized in two layers:"}]},{"id":"blk-47667","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47669","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54241","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cognitive primitives"},{"id":"spn-54242","text":" (OS-001 through OS-008) — one capability each"}]}],"id":"blk-47668","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47671","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54243","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cross-cutting protocols"},{"id":"spn-54244","text":" (OS-009 PRISM, OS-010 PULSE) — diagnostic + temporal layers above the primitives"}]}],"id":"blk-47670","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-47672","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54245","text":"The runtime output includes the Elixir governance package implementing OS-006 (shim) and OS-008 (harness), the "},{"id":"spn-54246","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM benchmark engine"},{"id":"spn-54247","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-54248","marks":["code"],"text":"/PRISM/"},{"id":"spn-54249","text":", Elixir/OTP, Fly.io, 6 MCP machines), and the "},{"id":"spn-54250","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE manifest standard"},{"id":"spn-54251","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-54252","marks":["code"],"text":"/PULSE/"},{"id":"spn-54253","text":", JSON Schema + reference manifests)."}]},{"id":"blk-47673","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54254","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47674","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54255","text":"The Ten Protocols"}]},{"id":"blk-47675","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54256","text":"Cognitive Primitives (OS-001 — OS-008)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-47677","spans":[{"id":"spn-54257","text":"Protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-47678","spans":[{"id":"spn-54258","text":"Name"}]},{"id":"blk-47679","spans":[{"id":"spn-54259","text":"Cognitive Basis"}]},{"id":"blk-47680","spans":[{"id":"spn-54260","text":"Implemented By"}]}],"id":"blk-47676","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-47681","spans":[{"id":"spn-54261","text":"OS-001"}]},{"id":"blk-47682","spans":[{"id":"spn-54262","text":"Continual Learning"}]},{"id":"blk-47683","spans":[{"id":"spn-54263","text":"Hippocampal consolidation"}]},{"id":"blk-47684","spans":[{"id":"spn-54264","text":"Graphonomous"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47685","spans":[{"id":"spn-54265","text":"OS-002"}]},{"id":"blk-47686","spans":[{"id":"spn-54266","text":"Topological Routing (κ)"}]},{"id":"blk-47687","spans":[{"id":"spn-54267","text":"Prefrontal gating"}]},{"id":"blk-47688","spans":[{"id":"spn-54268","text":"Graphonomous routing layer"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47689","spans":[{"id":"spn-54269","text":"OS-003"}]},{"id":"blk-47690","spans":[{"id":"spn-54270","text":"Deliberation Orchestrator"}]},{"id":"blk-47691","spans":[{"id":"spn-54271","text":"Dual-process theory"}]},{"id":"blk-47692","spans":[{"id":"spn-54272","text":"AgenTroMatic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47693","spans":[{"id":"spn-54273","text":"OS-004"}]},{"id":"blk-47694","spans":[{"id":"spn-54274","text":"Attention Engine"}]},{"id":"blk-47695","spans":[{"id":"spn-54275","text":"Endogenous attention"}]},{"id":"blk-47696","spans":[{"id":"spn-54276","text":"Graphonomous attention module"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47697","spans":[{"id":"spn-54277","text":"OS-005"}]},{"id":"blk-47698","spans":[{"id":"spn-54278","text":"Model Tier Adaptation"}]},{"id":"blk-47699","spans":[{"id":"spn-54279","text":"Resource rationality"}]},{"id":"blk-47700","spans":[{"id":"spn-54280","text":"Graphonomous / Agentelic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47701","spans":[{"id":"spn-54281","text":"OS-006"}]},{"id":"blk-47702","spans":[{"id":"spn-54282","text":"Agent Governance Shim"}]},{"id":"blk-47703","spans":[{"id":"spn-54283","text":"Executive function"}]},{"id":"blk-47704","spans":[{"id":"spn-54284","marks":["code"],"text":"open_sentience"},{"id":"spn-54285","text":" hex package"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47705","spans":[{"id":"spn-54286","text":"OS-007"}]},{"id":"blk-47706","spans":[{"id":"spn-54287","text":"Adversarial Robustness"}]},{"id":"blk-47707","spans":[{"id":"spn-54288","text":"Immune system"}]},{"id":"blk-47708","spans":[{"id":"spn-54289","text":"OpenSentience security module"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47709","spans":[{"id":"spn-54290","text":"OS-008"}]},{"id":"blk-47710","spans":[{"id":"spn-54291","text":"Agent Harness"}]},{"id":"blk-47711","spans":[{"id":"spn-54292","text":"Supervisory attentional system"}]},{"id":"blk-47712","spans":[{"id":"spn-54293","text":"OpenSentience harness module"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-47713","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54294","text":"Cross-Cutting Protocols (OS-009, OS-010)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-47715","spans":[{"id":"spn-54295","text":"Protocol"}]},{"id":"blk-47716","spans":[{"id":"spn-54296","text":"Name"}]},{"id":"blk-47717","spans":[{"id":"spn-54297","text":"Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-47718","spans":[{"id":"spn-54298","text":"Implemented By"}]}],"id":"blk-47714","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-47719","spans":[{"id":"spn-54299","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-009"}]},{"id":"blk-47720","spans":[{"id":"spn-54300","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM"},{"id":"spn-54301","text":" — Protocol for Rating Iterative System Memory"}]},{"id":"blk-47721","spans":[{"id":"spn-54302","marks":["bold"],"text":"Diagnostic algebra"},{"id":"spn-54303","text":" (measures loops over time)"}]},{"id":"blk-47722","spans":[{"id":"spn-54304","marks":["code"],"text":"/PRISM/"},{"id":"spn-54305","text":" Elixir/OTP, Fly.io, 6 MCP machines, "},{"id":"spn-54306","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://prism.opensentience.org"}],"text":"prism.opensentience.org"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47723","spans":[{"id":"spn-54307","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-010"}]},{"id":"blk-47724","spans":[{"id":"spn-54308","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE"},{"id":"spn-54309","text":" — Protocol for Uniform Loop State Exchange"}]},{"id":"blk-47725","spans":[{"id":"spn-54310","marks":["bold"],"text":"Temporal algebra"},{"id":"spn-54311","text":" (declares how loops cycle)"}]},{"id":"blk-47726","spans":[{"id":"spn-54312","marks":["code"],"text":"/PULSE/"},{"id":"spn-54313","text":" manifest standard, JSON Schema, reference manifests, "},{"id":"spn-54314","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://pulse.opensentience.org"}],"text":"pulse.opensentience.org"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-47727","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54315","text":"Each cognitive primitive maps a well-established cognitive science finding to a concrete software architecture. The cross-cutting protocols sit above them: PRISM measures how well a closed memory loop performs over time; PULSE declares how any loop in the [&] ecosystem cycles, nests, and signals across boundaries. Both are independent of one another and independent of [&] — a system may adopt one without the others."}]},{"id":"blk-47728","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54316","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47729","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54317","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-47730","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Homepages\n\n[&] Ampersand Box <https://ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous <https://graphonomous.com>\nBendScript <https://bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems <https://webhost.systems>\nAgentelic <https://agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic <https://agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic <https://delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic <https://deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt <https://fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic <https://geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience <https://opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt <https://specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock <https://ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-47731","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Root Docs\n\n[&] Protocol Docs <https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous Docs <https://docs.graphonomous.com>\nBendScript Docs <https://docs.bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems Docs <https://docs.webhost.systems>\nAgentelic Docs <https://docs.agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic Docs <https://docs.agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic Docs <https://docs.delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic Docs <https://docs.deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt Docs <https://docs.fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic Docs <https://docs.geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience Docs <https://docs.opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt Docs <https://docs.specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock Docs <https://docs.ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-47732","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 2\n:caption: OpenSentience Docs\n\narchitecture\nquickstart\npositioning\necosystem-overview\ncompetitive-landscape\nharness-engineering\nruntime-walkthrough\ncomparison-table\nresearch\nfaq\nspec/README\nspec/OS-008-HARNESS\nspec/OS-009-PRISM-SPECIFICATION\nspec/OS-010-PULSE-SPECIFICATION\nspec/OS-E001-EMPIRICAL-EVALUATION"},{"id":"blk-47733","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Skills\n\nskills/SKILLS\nskills/01_PROTOCOLS_OVERVIEW\nskills/02_AGENT_LIFECYCLE\nskills/03_PERMISSIONS\nskills/04_AUTONOMY_LEVELS\nskills/05_AUDIT_TRAILS\nskills/06_INTEGRATION\nskills/07_COGNITIVE_SCIENCE\nskills/08_ANTI_PATTERNS"},{"id":"blk-47734","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54318","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47735","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54319","text":"Suggested Reading Order"}]},{"id":"blk-47736","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54320","text":"If you are new to OpenSentience, follow this path:"}]},{"id":"blk-47737","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54321","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-54322","marks":["bold"],"text":"This page"},{"id":"spn-54323","text":" — understand scope and structure 2. "},{"id":"spn-54324","marks":["bold"],"text":"positioning"},{"id":"spn-54325","text":" — where OpenSentience fits in the agent governance landscape 3. "},{"id":"spn-54326","marks":["bold"],"text":"architecture"},{"id":"spn-54327","text":" — how the governance shim is built (OTP internals) 4. "},{"id":"spn-54328","marks":["bold"],"text":"quickstart"},{"id":"spn-54329","text":" — install the hex package and run your first governed agent 5. "},{"id":"spn-54330","marks":["bold"],"text":"ecosystem-overview"},{"id":"spn-54331","text":" — how all ten protocols connect across the [&] ecosystem 6. "},{"id":"spn-54332","marks":["bold"],"text":"harness-engineering"},{"id":"spn-54333","text":" — the emerging discipline of harness design and OS-008's position 7. "},{"id":"spn-54334","marks":["bold"],"text":"runtime-walkthrough"},{"id":"spn-54335","text":" — follow a concrete agent through governance + harness orchestration 8. "},{"id":"spn-54336","marks":["bold"],"text":"competitive-landscape"},{"id":"spn-54337","text":" — how OpenSentience compares to alternative approaches 9. "},{"id":"spn-54338","marks":["bold"],"text":"comparison-table"},{"id":"spn-54339","text":" — quick-reference feature comparison 10. "},{"id":"spn-54340","marks":["bold"],"text":"research"},{"id":"spn-54341","text":" — cognitive science grounding for each protocol 11. "},{"id":"spn-54342","marks":["bold"],"text":"faq"},{"id":"spn-54343","text":" — fill in remaining questions 12. "},{"id":"spn-54344","marks":["bold"],"text":"skills/"},{"id":"spn-54345","text":" — hands-on implementation skills for the governance shim"}]},{"id":"blk-47738","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54346","text":"For deep protocol specifics:"}]},{"id":"blk-47739","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47741","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54347","marks":["bold"],"text":"spec/README"},{"id":"spn-54348","text":" — the full technical specification (all ten protocols)"}]}],"id":"blk-47740","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47743","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54349","marks":["bold"],"text":"spec/OS-008-HARNESS"},{"id":"spn-54350","text":" — the Agent Harness Protocol specification"}]}],"id":"blk-47742","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47745","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54351","marks":["bold"],"text":"spec/OS-009-PRISM-SPECIFICATION"},{"id":"spn-54352","text":" — PRISM diagnostic benchmark protocol"}]}],"id":"blk-47744","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47747","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54353","marks":["bold"],"text":"spec/OS-010-PULSE-SPECIFICATION"},{"id":"spn-54354","text":" — PULSE loop manifest standard"}]}],"id":"blk-47746","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47749","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54355","marks":["bold"],"text":"spec/OS-E001-EMPIRICAL-EVALUATION"},{"id":"spn-54356","text":" — empirical evaluation of topology-aware continual learning"}]}],"id":"blk-47748","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-47750","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54357","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47751","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54358","text":"Documentation index"}]},{"id":"blk-47752","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54359","text":"Linked index of every page in this set (renders on GitHub and in the docs atlas; the toctrees above drive the Sphinx build):"}]},{"id":"blk-47753","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54360","marks":["bold"],"text":"Guides"}]},{"id":"blk-47754","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47756","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54361","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/quickstart.md"}],"text":"Quickstart"}]}],"id":"blk-47755","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47758","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54362","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/runtime-walkthrough.md"}],"text":"Runtime Walkthrough"}]}],"id":"blk-47757","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47760","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54363","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/positioning.md"}],"text":"Positioning — The Missing Constraint: Runtime Governance in the Agent Stack"}]}],"id":"blk-47759","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47762","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54364","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/competitive-landscape.md"}],"text":"Competitive Landscape — Agent Governance and Runtime Enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-47761","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47764","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54365","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/comparison-table.md"}],"text":"Comparison — OpenSentience vs. Alternatives"}]}],"id":"blk-47763","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47766","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54366","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/ecosystem-overview.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem Overview — How the Protocols Connect"}]}],"id":"blk-47765","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47768","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54367","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/research.md"}],"text":"Research Overview"}]}],"id":"blk-47767","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47770","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54368","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/faq.md"}],"text":"FAQ"}]}],"id":"blk-47769","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47772","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54369","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/skills/SKILLS.md"}],"text":"Agent Skills"}]}],"id":"blk-47771","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-47773","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54370","marks":["bold"],"text":"Specifications"}]},{"id":"blk-47774","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47776","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54371","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/spec/OS-011-EMBODIMENT.md"}],"text":"OS-011 — Embodiment Protocol"}]}],"id":"blk-47775","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47778","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54372","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/spec/OS-E001-EMPIRICAL-EVALUATION.md"}],"text":"OS-E001 — Empirical Evaluation of Topology-Aware Continual Learning"}]}],"id":"blk-47777","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-47779","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54373","marks":["bold"],"text":"UX & build prompts"}]},{"id":"blk-47780","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47782","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54374","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/docs/ux/user-stories-embodiment.md"}],"text":"Embodiment (body-browser + body-os) — User Stories"}]}],"id":"blk-47781","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-47784","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54375","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/opensentience.org/prompts/OS-008-BUILD.md"}],"text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol — Implementation Build Prompt"}]}],"id":"blk-47783","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-47785","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54376","text":"The Three Enforcement Layers"}]},{"id":"blk-47786","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54377","text":"OpenSentience provides three layers of runtime enforcement:"}]},{"id":"blk-47787","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"OS-008 Harness:   \"Has this agent followed the correct process?\"\n                   Pipeline ordering, quality gates, sprint contracts\n\nOS-006 Shim:      \"Is this agent allowed to do this?\"\n                   Permissions, lifecycle, autonomy levels\n\nOS-007 Security:  \"Is this agent under attack?\"\n                   Threat detection, identity verification, circuit breakers"},{"id":"blk-47788","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54378","text":"All three log to the same append-only audit trail, creating a unified compliance record from protocol to permission to pipeline."}]},{"id":"blk-47789","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54379","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47790","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54380","text":"The Three-Protocol Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-47791","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54381","text":"Above the cognitive primitives, OpenSentience publishes three sibling protocols that together turn the [&] portfolio into a measurable, composable, accountable agent substrate:"}]},{"id":"blk-47792","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  PRISM (OS-009) — measures loops over time   diagnostic │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  PULSE (OS-010) — declares loops + signals    temporal  │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  [&] Protocol     — composes capabilities     structural│\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"},{"head":[{"id":"blk-47794","spans":[{"id":"spn-54382","text":"Layer"}]},{"id":"blk-47795","spans":[{"id":"spn-54383","text":"Question"}]},{"id":"blk-47796","spans":[{"id":"spn-54384","text":"Artifact"}]}],"id":"blk-47793","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-47797","spans":[{"id":"spn-54385","text":"[&]"}]},{"id":"blk-47798","spans":[{"id":"spn-54386","text":"What can each agent do, and how do they compose?"}]},{"id":"blk-47799","spans":[{"id":"spn-54387","marks":["code"],"text":"*.ampersand.json"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47800","spans":[{"id":"spn-54388","text":"PULSE"}]},{"id":"blk-47801","spans":[{"id":"spn-54389","text":"How do their processes cycle and signal each other?"}]},{"id":"blk-47802","spans":[{"id":"spn-54390","marks":["code"],"text":"*.pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-54391","text":" (loop manifest)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-47803","spans":[{"id":"spn-54392","text":"PRISM"}]},{"id":"blk-47804","spans":[{"id":"spn-54393","text":"How well do those cycles actually work over time?"}]},{"id":"blk-47805","spans":[{"id":"spn-54394","text":"Diagnostic reports + leaderboards"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-47806","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54395","text":"A loop is "},{"id":"spn-54396","marks":["bold"],"text":"PULSE-conforming"},{"id":"spn-54397","text":" if its manifest validates against "},{"id":"spn-54398","marks":["code"],"text":"pulse-loop-manifest.v0.1.json"},{"id":"spn-54399","text":" and its runtime passes the 12-test conformance suite. A system is "},{"id":"spn-54400","marks":["bold"],"text":"PRISM-evaluable"},{"id":"spn-54401","text":" automatically once it is PULSE-conforming — PRISM's "},{"id":"spn-54402","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-54403","text":" phase reads the manifest, injects scenarios at the declared "},{"id":"spn-54404","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-54405","text":" boundary, and observes outcomes via the declared "},{"id":"spn-54406","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-54407","text":" phase. Adoption order is typically [&] → PULSE → PRISM."}]},{"id":"blk-47807","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54408","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47808","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54409","text":"Relationship to the [&] Ecosystem"}]},{"id":"blk-47809","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54410","text":"OpenSentience occupies the "},{"id":"spn-54411","marks":["bold"],"text":"governance and research layer"},{"id":"spn-54412","text":" of the [&] stack:"}]},{"id":"blk-47810","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  [&] Protocol        — capability composition (what an agent CAN do)\n  OpenSentience       — governance + harness (what an agent MAY do, and how)\n  Graphonomous        — memory + learning (OS-001, OS-002, OS-004, OS-005)\n  AgenTroMatic        — deliberation (OS-003)\n  Delegatic           — policy authoring (feeds into OS-006 enforcement)\n  Agentelic           — agent manifests (consumed by OS-006 install)\n  FleetPrompt         — marketplace (agents enter governance on install)\n  SpecPrompt          — acceptance criteria (consumed by OS-008 quality gates)"},{"id":"blk-47811","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54413","text":"The governance shim wraps any OTP "},{"id":"spn-54414","marks":["code"],"text":"child_spec"},{"id":"spn-54415","text":". It does not replace the supervised process — it interposes permission checks, lifecycle management, autonomy control, pipeline enforcement, and audit logging around it."}]},{"id":"blk-47812","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54416","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-47813","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-54417","text":"Founding Thesis"}]},{"id":"blk-47814","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54418","text":"OpenSentience exists because intelligence without governance is generation without accumulation. The ten protocols formalize what structured accumulation requires: memory that consolidates, routing that detects cycles, deliberation that resolves conflict, attention that prioritizes, resources that adapt, governance that enforces boundaries, security that detects threats, a harness that orchestrates the entire pipeline, "},{"id":"spn-54419","marks":["bold"],"text":"diagnostics that measure whether the loop actually learns"},{"id":"spn-54420","text":" (PRISM), and a "},{"id":"spn-54421","marks":["bold"],"text":"temporal manifest"},{"id":"spn-54422","text":" that lets every loop in the ecosystem declare how it cycles and signals (PULSE)."}]},{"id":"blk-47815","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-54423","text":"The shim is deliberately thin. Governance should cost less than 1% of the system it governs. PULSE is a manifest standard with no required runtime. PRISM runs as a separate benchmark engine that any system can opt into via its PULSE manifest."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraqxq77pydxhttgmkxbxcgoqlavg5g3alkkvthwe7qcvsgyh76hipa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}